{"name": "Teeko", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adventure through the seven provinces of Costa Rica as Teeko, a cute sloth tasked with defeating the rampaging gigante masks of Costa Rica\u2019s D\u00eda de las Mascaradas festival. Jump, smash, and plant trees through the perfect mix of platforming and tower defense as you face hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"414\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/c659fe620ddaca843406075f4f452bf8.poster.avif?t=1783259448\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/c659fe620ddaca843406075f4f452bf8.webm?t=1783259448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/c659fe620ddaca843406075f4f452bf8.mp4?t=1783259448\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and boost your tree towers to throw different fruits at your enemies faces. Some of them fall only to towers, others only to dunking, and some require both. Put on your strategizing hat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"414\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/b201b87007d81a744d393ab1f97bade5.poster.avif?t=1783259448\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/b201b87007d81a744d393ab1f97bade5.webm?t=1783259448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/b201b87007d81a744d393ab1f97bade5.mp4?t=1783259448\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/>Spice-up the battlefield by choosing from Tita\u2019s traditional dish recipes and obtain special power-ups for Teeko and his towers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"414\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/9ae714c5bb27bc5a8a4673bc808d4890.poster.avif?t=1783259448\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/9ae714c5bb27bc5a8a4673bc808d4890.webm?t=1783259448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/9ae714c5bb27bc5a8a4673bc808d4890.mp4?t=1783259448\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through the seven worlds inspired by Costa Rica\u2019s provinces, each culminating in endless waves and platforming obstacles in preparation for one game-bending final boss battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"414\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/783b2d7d326720b5c9495a9dc536c4e4.poster.avif?t=1783259448\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/783b2d7d326720b5c9495a9dc536c4e4.webm?t=1783259448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/783b2d7d326720b5c9495a9dc536c4e4.mp4?t=1783259448\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras_big/81e8b83d2e536c8ba3032ebd5317d853.avif?t=1783259448\" height=\"274\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/extras/81e8b83d2e536c8ba3032ebd5317d853.avif?t=1783259448\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Happy snacking!</i> <br/>- Teeko</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Hop on the perfect mix of platforming and tower defense as Teeko, a cute sloth. Jump, smash, and plant trees to defeat the rampaging gigante masks of Costa Rica\u2019s D\u00eda de las Mascaradas festival and their hordes of enemies.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650150/7032f1a4dc035d753edcc01c7fab0d1f23dd7d0c/header.jpg?t=1783259448", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Pixel Graphics", "2D Platformer", "Tower Defense", "Action", "Strategy", "Platformer"], "developers": "Ripe Render", "publishers": "Ripe Render", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3650150", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "4 June 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/VrorX-iz0po", "first_seen": 1780524000.0, "review_rank": 473}